{"id":"gerede","lemma":"Gerede","pos":"noun","rank":2646,"glosses":["gossip, gossiping","chatter, babble"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʁeːdə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/De-Gerede.ogg/De-Gerede.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Geredes"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist doch alles bloß Gerede.","en":"That's all just talk.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"but / yes"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"merely, only"},null]},{"text":"All dieses Gerede macht mich ganz hungrig.","en":"All this talk is making me hungry.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"entire"},{"g":"hungry"}]},{"text":"Ich kümmere mich nicht um das Gerede der Leute.","en":"I don't care what people say.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take care","l":"kümmern"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"people"}]},{"text":"Sein endloses Gerede langweilt mich.","en":"I got bored with his long talk.","words":[{"g":"to be"},null,null,{"g":"to bore","l":"langweilen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"}]}]}